{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果最新推出的PROLED MacBook Pro重新帶回了曾經極具辨識度的發光蘋果Logo，而來自維修機構iFixit的拆解報告則揭開了這一經典設計回歸背後的實現方式。儘管新機型在可維修性方面有所改善，但拆解顯示，這枚重新點亮的蘋果標誌實際上隱藏着相當複雜的結構設計，一旦出現故障，維修難度依然不低。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585874.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.488149+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:56:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_hash":"6440b609f250bb1e538795c7f6751cdd02b3e6d45632bc0eff188fedc3633fe4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}